	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t07pc0101_oldwoman1_02">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>のろいのおふだを　もたせると
ゴーストタイプの▽
わざの　いりょくが　あがるのさ▼
はて？　のろいのおふだ……
いったい　どこで　みつけたのかね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T05:08:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T11:35:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>のろいのおふだを　持たせると
ゴーストタイプの▽
技の　威力が　あがるのさ▼
はて？　のろいのおふだ……
いったい　どこで　みつけたのかね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-26T05:09:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T11:35:37" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手後

※メッセージ要調整</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T03:59:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>老婆</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-24T11:35:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
